| Activity | Date | Location | Auditor days |
|---|---|---|---|
| Remote document review and videoconference with RTM-3, GOT-4, KLJ-5 | 4 September 2024 | Remote | 0.5 |
| On-site day 1 | 9 September 2024 | Gdynia (GDY-1) | 2.0 |
